        "content": "<p>We have that S_5 is not solvable: <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Equiv.Perm.not_isSolvable_fin_5#doc\">docs#Equiv.Perm.not_isSolvable_fin_5</a>. Do we have that S_4 is solvable? We need this for CGT, since it implies a field which is quadratically and cubically closed is also quartically closed.</p>",
