    {
        "content": "<p>To reduce to the alternating group, you can use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=alternatingGroup.commutator_perm_le#doc\">docs#alternatingGroup.commutator_perm_le</a><br>\nFor n&lt;=3, you can use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=alternatingGroup.isMulCommutative_of_card_le_three#doc\">docs#alternatingGroup.isMulCommutative_of_card_le_three</a><br>\nFor n=4, you can use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=alternatingGroup.kleinFour_eq_commutator#doc\">docs#alternatingGroup.kleinFour_eq_commutator</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=IsKleinFour.isMulCommutative#doc\">docs#IsKleinFour.isMulCommutative</a></p>",
